⊡‹tl_strip›⇒s⇐s 0‹tl_skipws›⇒i⇐s≢⇒j{⇐j⇐i»[1⋄⇐s⇐j 1-⊇‹tl_isws›]⋄⇣j}⇐s⇐i⇐j⇐i-‹slice›;
⊡‹tl_dgglyph›⇒b“ʘ“⊃⇐b 128<1+[⋄←‹b2g›⇐b‹has›[←‹b2g›⇐b‹get›⧺^]]
⇐b 32»⇐b 127<$1+[‹vec›⇐b⍆⋄“\x“⊃⇐b‹tl_hx2›⧺]⧺;
